#: aboutwidget.cpp:40 main.cpp:89
msgid "KDE Control Center"
msgstr "KDE kontrolni centar"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:42
msgid "Configure your desktop environment."
msgstr "Podesite vaše desktop okruženje."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:44
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Control Center\", a central place to configure your "
"desktop environment. Select an item from the index on the left to load a "
"configuration module."
msgstr ""
"Dobrodošli u \"KDE kontrolni centar\". Ovo je centralno mjesto za "
"podešavanje vašeg desktop okruženja. Izaberite stavku u indeksu s lijeve "
"strane koju želite uređivati."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:50
msgid ""
"Click on the \"<b>Help</b>\" tab on the left to view help for the active "
"control module. Use the \"<b>Search</b>\" tab if you are unsure where to "
"look for a particular configuration option."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na \"<b>Pomoć</b>\" na lijevoj strani ako želite dobiti "
"informacije o aktivnom kontrolnom modulu. Pritisnite \"<b>Traži</b>\" ako "
"niste sigurni gdje možete naći određenu konfiguracijsku opciju."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:56
msgid "KDE version:"
msgstr "KDE verzija: "

#: aboutwidget.cpp:57
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Korisnik: "

#: aboutwidget.cpp:58
msgid "Hostname:"
msgstr "Ime računara: "

#: aboutwidget.cpp:59
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Sistem:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:60
msgid "Release:"
msgstr "Izdanje: "

#: aboutwidget.cpp:61
msgid "Machine:"
msgstr "Mašina: "

#: dockcontainer.cpp:43 modules.cpp:148
msgid "<big>Loading ...</big>"
msgstr "<big>Učitavam...</big>"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:79 toplevel.cpp:324
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before running the new module or forget the "
"changes?"
msgstr ""
"Promjene u aktivnim modulima nisu sačuvane.\n"
"Da li prvo želite primjeniti promjene prije izvršavanja\n"
"novog modula ili želite zaboraviti promjene?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:82 toplevel.cpp:327
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before exiting the Control Center or forget "
"the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Promjene u aktivnim modulima nisu spremljene.\n"
"Da li prvo želite primjeniti promjene prije izlaska\n"
"ili želite zaboraviti promjene?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:85 toplevel.cpp:330
msgid "Unsaved Changes"
msgstr "Nesačuvane promjene"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:87 toplevel.cpp:332
msgid "&Forget"
msgstr "&Zaboravi"

#: helpwidget.cpp:58
msgid "<br><br>To read the full manual click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>."
msgstr "<br><br>Za čitanje čitavog priručnika kliknite <a href=\"%1\">ovjde</a>."

#: helpwidget.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Control Center</h1>Sorry, there is no quick help available for the "
"active control module."
"<br>"
"<br>Click <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">here</a> to read the general "
"control center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>KDE kontrolni centar</h1>Žalim, kontrolni centar ne sadrži "
"Brzu pomoć za aktivne kontrolne module."
"<br>"
"<br>Kliknite <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">ovdje</a> za opća"
"uputstva."

